  "prefLabel": "Env-A 903.02 General Recordkeeping Requirements for Process Operations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 903.02 General Recordkeeping Requirements for Process Operations. The owner or operator of each process shall maintain the following material use or production records on a monthly basis:\n\n(a) The total quantities of all materials used or produced in each process that are necessary to calculate emissions, to verify applicability and compliance with all emission limitations, or to verify production capacities and quantities; and\n\n(b) For a source operating more than one process, all operational data needed to estimate the distribution of the usages, production, and emissions from such processes.\n\nSource. #6983-B, eff 4-23-99; ss by #8872, eff 4-21-07; ss by #10892, eff 7-18-15; ss by #14374, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a900.html"
